The pollen data are Open Government Data of the Federal Office of Meteorology
and Climatology MeteoSwiss (national pollen monitoring network, STAC
collection ch.meteoschweiz.ogd-pollen), used under the MeteoSwiss terms of use
for open data: Source: MeteoSwiss. The widgets and the documentation name the
source, as these terms ask.

The pollen load classes come from the MeteoSwiss document "Threshold values
for pollen load classes of allergenic pollen types" (2024-01-10).

